knob:
В секции отзывов (около L589) обернуть каждый отзыв в `<blockquote itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Review"><p itemprop="reviewBody">…текст отзыва…</p><footer>— <span itemprop="author">Имя Фамилия</span></footer></blockquote>`; добавить в `<head>` JSON‑LD‑скрипт:
```html
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
"@context":"https://schema.org",
"@type":"ItemList",
"itemListElement":[
{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@type":"Review","reviewBody":"…","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Имя"}}},
{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@type":"Review","reviewBody":"…","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Имя"}}}
]
}
</script>
```

